ix}\n$$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "- $H$ is *not* a diagonal matrix. It's a square matrix since it has the same number of rows and columns. But some of the entries that do not lie on the main diagonal are not zeros (for instance, ${h}_{12}=1\\ne 0$).\n\n- $J$ is a diagonal matrix. It's a square matrix since it has the same number of rows and columns. Also, all the entries that do not lie on the main diagonal are zeros.\n\nNotice that $J$ is not an identity matrix since the diagonal entries are not all ones.\n\n- $L$ is *not* a diagonal matrix. It's a square matrix since it has the same number of rows and columns. But some of the entries that do not lie on the main diagonal are not zeros (for instance, ${l}_{14}=1\\ne 0$).\n\nTherefore, only $J$ is a diagonal matrix."} {:db/id 17592186088358 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "09fa0899-a3d2-584f-8cdd-a471f8cfd16b" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying a Special Square Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9845943d-1069-5846-946f-55acd5be9b41" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$B$ and $C$ only" :db/id 17592186086802} {:answer/id #uuid "a7d9a20e-5493-552c-b8b5-447cac55eb99" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$B$ and $D$ only" :db/id 17592186086803} {:answer/id #uuid "d1c49f12-97f5-5061-8d94-d7bdfc7c4e38" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$C$ and $D$ only" :db/id 17592186086804} {:answer/id #uuid "4debdeda-eaff-5ff0-8468-c12db7ca3e83" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$B$, $C$, and $D$" :db/id 17592186086805} {:answer/id #uuid "6951dc12-4201-5ae3-b63c-d2cf0264a097" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$D$ only" :db/id 17592186086806}] :answer-field/id #uuid "0c128366-6a1f-56af-9e8d-54a2d6ad2502" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186086801}] :question/id #uuid